**For all models**

:::{dropdown} Model export
Option `tech:writemodel`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#model-export)
:::

:::{dropdown} Solution export
Option `tech:writesolution`. Writes the solution in the solver's native format, e.g., `writesol=model.sol`.
:::

:::{dropdown} Irreducible inconsistent subset (IIS)
Option `iis:find`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#irreducible-inconsistent-subset-iis)
:::

:::{dropdown} Multiple solutions
Option `sol:stub`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#multiple-solutions)
:::

:::{dropdown} Multiple objectives
Emulated by MP. Option `obj:multi`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#multiple-objectives)
:::

:::{dropdown} Warm start
Option `alg:start`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#warm-start)
:::

**For MIP models**

:::{dropdown} Fixed model (duals and basis for a MIP)
Option `mip:basis`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#fixed-model-return-basis-for-mip)
:::

:::{dropdown} MIP gap
Option `mip:return_gap`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#return-mip-gap)
:::

:::{dropdown} Best dual bound
Option `mip:bestbound`. [Details](https://mp.ampl.com/features-guide.html#return-best-dual-bound)
:::
